      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">Your tour includes a four-night cruise aboard M/V Ventus Australis. Amenities include a restaurant, lounges, Zodiac expedition boats, on-board lectures, open bridge, and panoramic open deck.</p>
    </div>
