      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 5px;">Your Tour Price Includes</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt;">
        <li>Round-trip air transportation from listed cities; all flights within Argentina and Chile</li>
        <li>13 nights’ accommodations at 4-star hotels, 4 nights M/V Ventus Australis (Superior First Class); 9 nights in Deluxe, Superior First Class and First Class hotels</li>
